{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27809","headline":"春色满皇州 · 裴夷直","name":"春色满皇州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒销山水地，春遍帝王州。\n北阙晴光动，南山喜气浮。\n夭红粧暖树，急绿走阴沟。\n思妇开香阁，王孙上玉楼。\n氛氲直城北，骀荡曲江头。\n今日灵台下，翻然却是愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴夷直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}